	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><pb type="scan" next="312"/><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. et pacem.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p18067">Heldum</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p18067">Jakob Held von Tiefenau</persName>; s. oben <ref target="file12290">Nr. 2243</ref>,4.</note> ut nunquam antea vidi, ita nec nomen audivi.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Per occasionem huc venit ad quendam<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Unbekannt.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>divertens<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">venit ... divertens: kam und kehrte ein.</note> mihi notum; qui ipse tamen incolam agit ad tempus.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Illi ergo, quid inter se, nescio.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Me vocant, ut <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>sim conviva.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Invitus paro.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Advenientem <persName ref="p18067">Heldus</persName> salutat satis aulice.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Ego, meo more respondens, ad mensam <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>adducor.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Considemus, confabulamur, ut fit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Tum is, inter alia <persName ref="p8441">Schwencfeldii</persName><note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4"><persName ref="p8441">Kaspar Schwenckfeld</persName>.</note> memor, se discipulum <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>eius libere confitetur.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Horrui, fateor, nam id nominis odi ab aliquot iam annis.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Pergit ille, qualiter coeperat.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Au<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>scultavi, donec veniret ad mentionem de colloquio<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Siehe oben <ref target="file12290">Nr. 2243</ref>, 1-3.</note>; qua de re sic loquebatur, tanquam bona spes esset, si inter <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>vos invicem audiretis coram, futuram concordiam ecclesię maxime profuturam.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">„Hoc unum“, inquit, „in praesens <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>deest, quod neminem habeo, qui a <persName ref="p8049">Vadiano</persName> et <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinis</placeName> colloquium impetrare conetur.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Quid si <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>tu, quem amatorem pacis et concordię non semel esse audivi, hanc provinciolam susciperes?“</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Hic ego paucis: „<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Non is sum, cuius persuasionibus magni viri permoveantur; quamobrem non intercedere, sed animum tuum <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>illis indicare me posse non gravate suscipio, quicquid illi tandem respondeant.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Persuasus sum enim <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>meam hic operam illos boni consulturos.“</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">His auditis vir ille sibi gratulari videbatur, quod invenisset, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>qui se tam praebuisset facilem.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">„Hactenus enim non repertum, qui tantillum istud, indicare nempe, subire <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>sustineret.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Quid in indicando peccati esset, dum perspicere non possem, perrexi, ac praestiti, quod promiseram, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>sed adeo tepide, qualiter literę meę<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Brief <ref target="file12290">Nr. 2243</ref> vom 13. September. Siehe ferner <ref target="file12299">Nr. 2252</ref>, 50-53.</note>, quas tu habes, non ego, probant, ut inde facile queas animum meum <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>cognoscere, modo libeat.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Addidi consilium,<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Siehe oben <ref target="file12290">Nr. 2243</ref>, 14-20.</note> quę mihi viderentur in consultatione dispicienda, prius<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>quam ad colloquium admitteretur: rem ipsam, personam erroneam et <placeName ref="l862">Helvetię</placeName> periculum (ubi quidem, <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>ut clare dicam, respexi ad <persName ref="p4627">Denckium</persName><note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8"><persName ref="p4627">Hans Denck</persName>.</note> anabaptistam, ad <persName ref="p4349">Carolstadium</persName><note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9"><persName ref="p4349">Andreas Karlstadt von Bodenstein</persName>.</note>, ad <persName ref="p7580">Huttenum</persName><note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10"><persName ref="p7580">Ulrich von Hutten</persName>.</note>, ad <persName ref="p7678">deca<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>num</persName> <placeName ref="l1204">Pataviensem</placeName><note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11"><persName ref="p7678">Ruprecht von Mosham</persName>, Domdekan von <placeName ref="l1204">Passau</placeName>.</note>, credo, non prorsus imprudenter)<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>Klammern ergänzt.</hi></note> - quibus omnibus nihil aliud volui quam sententiam meam de homine <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>ad colloquium non recipiendo (ni vobis secus videretur) cognosci ac praevenire de me malam suspicionem.[“]</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Veruntamen quid sim adsequutus, patet ex literis vestris<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12">Brief Nr. 2255 vom 28. September.</note>.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Timetis mihi, non ne sim, sed ne fiam <persName ref="p8441">Sch<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>wencfeldianus</persName>.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Bone deus!</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Quam sum in scribendo infelix, qui omnibus, quę scripsi, praevenire non potui, <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>quin de me male suspicemini circa dogma istud tam inauditum<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13">Vgl. schon oben <ref target="file12290">Nr. 2243</ref>, 6-10; 2252, 51-53.</note>!</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Ego fierem <persName ref="p8441">Schwencfeldianus</persName>, qui vix <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>intelligo, quidnam sibi velit!</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Hactenus simplicia sector atque certa; quae ille scribit, quantum ego quidem <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>novi, talia sunt, ut dicam<pb type="edition" next="568"/> ingenue nescire me, quid sint, et, postquam ad extremum deveni, dubito, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>an, quę habet in animo, queat, ut intelligantur, recte proloqui.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Tanto etiam tempore nomen illius ex<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>osum habui propter turbas, quas excitavit in ecclesiis nonnullis et apud simpliciores quosdam <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>e nobilitate viros et mulieres, ut illud ipsum non tam audire quam legere in libellorum titulis sępius <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>recusarim.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">De libellis ipsis taceo, quos inspicere nunquam volui vel rogatum, posteaquam audieram ill<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>ud esse dogma: In morte Christum omnem humanitatem exuisse et factum deum totum.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la">Novum<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14">Novum dogma.</note> ete<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>nim erat, absurdum, abominabile.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Pręterea non semel audivi, quę insolentia et arrogantia <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>sit in illis hominibus; atque idem tandem expertus sum ex literis longissimis <persName ref="p7506">mulieris</persName> cuiusdam nobilis<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="15">Wohl <persName ref="p7506">Margareta von Grafeneck, geb. Scher (Schär)</persName> von <placeName ref="l3635">Schwarzenburg</placeName>; s. oben <ref target="file12290">Nr. 2243</ref>, Anm. 5.</note> ad <persName ref="p1704">sororem</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>suam<note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="16">Möglicherweise <persName ref="p1704">Elisabeth Hecklin, geb. Scher</persName>; s. aaO.</note> - quas<note xml:id="fn17" type="footnote" n="17">Gemeint ist der Brief.</note> quidem hęc<note xml:id="fn18" type="footnote" ana="lex" n="18">soror.</note> legendas et examinandas, imo et ad respondendum mihi obtulerat; <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>in qua re quidem et operam praestiti<note xml:id="fn19" type="footnote" n="19">Vgl. oben <ref target="file12290">Nr. 2243</ref>, 10-12.</note>.</s>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la">Demum experientia quoque didici contemptum illorum contra ministerium <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>verbi, contra coenam domini (ut quam adserunt haud esse necessariam)<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>Klammern ergänzt.</hi></note>, contra doctrinam et <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>fidem nostram (ut quę cavenda esse plane clamant)<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>Klammern ergänzt.</hi></note>.</s>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la">His cognitis et multis adhuc aliis - et quidem <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>longe gravioribus - etiamnum timetis, ne fiam <persName ref="p8441">Schwencfeldi</persName> discipulus!</s>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la">Sed iam pridem, quod sum indo<lb xml:id="p1z38"/>ctior et rerum minus peritus, coepistis me suspicionibus onerare (quam rem domino committo)<note xml:id="fn20" type="footnote" n="20">Vgl. <bibl source="b17">HBBW XIV</bibl> 16 und passim.</note>!</s>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la">Idem <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>igitur dum hodie facitis, tolerandum est et patientia vincendum<note xml:id="fn21" type="footnote" n="21">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>2Kor 1.6</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="36" xml:lang="la">Ego interim loco non moveor, <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>quia domum, uti spero, inędificavi petrę<note xml:id="fn22" type="footnote" n="22">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 7, 24f par.</ref></cit></note>.</s>
					<s n="37" xml:lang="la">Credo enim Iesum esse Christum filium dei vivi,<note xml:id="fn23" type="footnote" n="23"><cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 16, 16</ref></cit>.</note> verum <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>deum et verum hominem,<note xml:id="fn24" type="footnote" n="24">Aus dem "Ersten <placeName ref="l862">Helvetischen</placeName> Bekenntnis" (1536), hier auf das Bekenntnis von <placeName ref="l1652">Chalcedon</placeName> (451) zurückgreifend.</note> et talem nunc sedere ad dexteram dei patris omnipotentis<note xml:id="fn25" type="footnote" n="25">Zitat aus dem "Apostolischen Glaubensbekenntnis".</note> ac interceder<lb xml:id="p1z42"/>e pro nobis<note xml:id="fn26" type="footnote" n="26"><cit type="bible"><ref>Röm 8, 34</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="38" xml:lang="la">Magis extollere Christum <persName ref="p8441">Schwencfeldius</persName> non poterit, quicquid de absorpta nugetur humanitate<note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d">te <hi>in</hi> humanitate <hi>über der Zeile nachgetragen.</hi></note><note xml:id="fn27" type="footnote" n="27">Vgl. oben <ref target="file12301">Nr. 2254</ref>, 49-81.</note>!</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="39" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z43"/>Vellem itaque, ut tu et fratres tui aliquanto civilius - ne quid aliud dicam - sentiretis de me; tum enim <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>non adeo contemptim ac imperiose scripsissetis:</s>
					<s n="40" xml:lang="de">„Und lassind ir uns furohin sin halb unbe<lb xml:id="p1z45"/>kümmert!“<note xml:id="fn28" type="footnote" n="28">Oben Nr. 2255, 22f.</note></s>
					<s n="41" xml:lang="la">Si fui molestus significatione tantum voluntatis <persName ref="p8441">Schwencfeldii</persName> (cui tamen adieci consilium <lb xml:id="p1z46"/>de eo non audiendo, imo non admittendo in <placeName ref="l862">Helvetiam</placeName>)<note xml:id="fne" type="footnote" n="e"><hi>Klammern ergänzt.</hi></note>, melius fuerit deinceps nihil indicare, <lb xml:id="p1z47"/>nihil scribere, ne vos turbem (non enim turbator, sed conciliator<pb type="edition" next="569"/> hactenus deo gratia <lb xml:id="p1z48"/>audivi), ni animus vester alius sit erga me, quam exprimunt verba.</s>
					<s n="42" xml:lang="la">Non est enim vocum in imperio <lb xml:id="p1z49"/>illo vestro vel una, quę non sit dicta <foreign xml:lang="el">ἐμϕατικῶς</foreign>.</s>
					<s n="43" xml:lang="la">Sed quicquid sit, equidem fero, et dico <lb xml:id="p1z50"/>verbum tale non decere fratres erga fratrem, nihil eius commeritum.</s>
					<s n="44" xml:lang="la">Ego, ita me dominus bene amet, <lb xml:id="p1z51"/>sincerissimo animo scripsi.</s>
					<s n="45" xml:lang="la">Vos hanc sinceritatem vel non intellexistis vel dissimulastis in literis <lb xml:id="p1z52"/>ad me datis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="46" xml:lang="la">Ut clare dicam igitur: Non placet animo meo, ut <persName ref="p8441">Gaspar Schwencfeldius</persName> admittatur <lb xml:id="p1z53"/>ad colloquium in <placeName ref="l862">Helvetiis</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="47" xml:lang="la">Nam, tametsi scriptum est: „Omnia probate, quod bonum est, tenete“,<note xml:id="fn29" type="footnote" n="29"><cit type="bible"><ref>1Thess 5,21.</ref></cit> - Vgl. oben <ref target="file12301">Nr. 2254</ref>, 43f.</note> tamen<pb type="scan" next="311"/> <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>adeo videtur absurdum, quod ille proponit (quantumvis adducat multa tum ex scripturis pro se, tum ex patrib[us]<note xml:id="fnf" type="footnote" n="f"><hi>Hier und unten Textverlust durch Papierverlust am rechten Rand.</hi></note>)<note xml:id="fng" type="footnote" n="g"><hi>Klammern ergänzt.</hi></note>, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>ut audiendus sit haudquaquam, praesertim autem in <placeName ref="l862">Helvetiis</placeName>, ut quos petere videtur vir, exilio propemod[um] <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>destinatus, ob causas sibi forsitan conducibiles, illi vero non vulgariter periculosas.</s>
					<s n="48" xml:lang="la">Interim ego feci o<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>f[f]icium et erga vos (ut quos certiores feci meo<note xml:id="fn30" type="footnote" ana="lex" n="30">meo officio.</note> videre simpliciter et amice de animo <persName ref="p8441">Schwencfeldii</persName>)<note xml:id="fnh" type="footnote" n="h"><hi>Klammern ergänzt.</hi></note> et erga <persName ref="p18067">Heldum</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>(qui, sic ut facerem, rogavit)<note xml:id="fni" type="footnote" n="i"><hi>Klammern ergänzt.</hi></note>.</s>
					<s n="49" xml:lang="la">Ideo igitur placent omnia, quę scripsistis usque ad imperium<note xml:id="fn31" type="footnote" n="31">Vgl. oben Z. 63.</note> plus ęquo insua<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>ve et austerum amico.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="50" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/>De reliquis in epistola tua gratias ago tibi.</s>
					<s n="51" xml:lang="la">Placet mihi quoque <persName ref="p8354">Lęti</persName><note xml:id="fn32" type="footnote" n="32"><persName ref="p8354">Georg Frölich</persName>.</note> humanitas in omnibus, tametsi non [no]<lb xml:id="p2z8"/>vi nisi ex scriptis.</s>
					<s n="52" xml:lang="la">Dum iungis duos archigrammatęos<note xml:id="fn33" type="footnote" n="33"><persName ref="p8354">Georg Frölich</persName> und <persName ref="p257">Werner Beyel</persName>; s. oben Nr. 2255, 26-29.</note> - alterum vivum, alterum defunctum -, inci[dit] <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>de successione nescio quid;<note xml:id="fn34" type="footnote" n="34">Siehe aber oben Nr. 2255, Anm. 15.</note> nam illud constat, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurum</placeName> <persName ref="p8354">Lęto</persName> non displicere, <placeName ref="l18">Augustanorum</placeName> autem <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>luxum maxime.</s>
					<s n="53" xml:lang="la">Iam ad ambas tuas, puto, respondi<note xml:id="fn35" type="footnote" n="35">Vgl. oben <ref target="file12302">Nr. 2255</ref>, 31, und Anm. 171.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="54" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale in Christo cum <persName ref="p8127">Pellicano</persName> et <persName ref="p8171">Theodoro</persName><note xml:id="fn36" type="footnote" n="36"><persName ref="p8171">Theodor Bibliander</persName>.</note> et [cę]teris.</s>
					<s n="55" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z11"/><placeName ref="l28">Basileae</placeName>, 3. octobris anno 1545.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="56" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8418">Os. Myconius</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse darunter:]</note>
					<s n="57" xml:lang="la">D. <persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullinge<lb xml:id="p2z12"/>ro</persName>, fratri in domino ve<lb xml:id="p2z13"/>nerando suo.</s>
				</p>
